WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
Open Review. Select the fictional 90.50 imported purchase.

00:03.500 --> 00:08.300
Press Shift-S. Add a split and find Groceries.

00:08.300 --> 00:11.000
Assign 72.40 to Groceries.

00:11.000 --> 00:14.600
Add Household as a second category.

00:14.600 --> 00:17.000
Leave the final amount blank. The remainder is 18.10.

00:17.000 --> 00:21.000
Preview the whole transaction: one bank credit and two expense debits.

00:21.000 --> 00:24.500
Press y to confirm. Open the Journal.

00:24.500 --> 00:29.000
Inspect the posted entry. Three balanced postings retain the statement evidence.
